# Summary

| Concern | Core pattern |
| ----------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------- |
| Lint | Warn globally + diff ratchet + strict pre-commit + scoped fixes |
| CI | Taxonomy of gates; every blocker runnable locally |
| Policy | Docs ↔ agent rules ↔ linter presets ↔ custom validators |
| Folder layout | Detect shape · durable blueprint · placement + naming · structure gates — [`folder-structure`](./folder-structure.mdc) |
| SDD | SPEC.md · §G…§B · concise · ownership · right-size · no SDD sub-agents |
| Pre-build | Reach-for: grill / research / code-review / codebase-design when blast earns it |
| Code | KISS, rule-of-three DRY, SOLID at seams, deep modules, no `any` |
| Security | Authorize every boundary; tenant scope; secrets out of source |
| Observability | Wide events; one JSON log per request; business + env context |
| Review | Tagged severity; loop on critical/high/med |
| Agent library | Core / pre-build / stack tiers; single-responsibility skills |
| Agents — ship | Phased orchestrator, JSON gates, specialists, human spec gate |
| Agents — delegation | Compressed investigator/builder/reviewer contracts |
| Communication | Concise compression + auto-clarity for safety-critical output |
| Release / envs | `dev`→`staging`→`main` · rebase · Release Please — [`release-lifecycle`](../references/ship/release-lifecycle.md) |
| Stacked PRs | Small layers · `gh stack` · ≤20–30 files/layer — [`stacking-prs`](./stacking-prs.mdc) |

Adapt tool names, paths, and thresholds to your repository. The patterns are the product; the implementation is yours.

